        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(1) Former employees who were laid off by the Company with recall rights, or who left under a Facility Closing Program (FCP), or employees who left the Company because of an authorized hardship or a Lucent trailing spouse condition will be able to nominate for openings for a period of three (3) years from the date of termination.",
